{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日，網上流傳片段顯示中印兩軍在邊境對峙。</p><p>中國外交部發言人郭嘉昆在周一的例行記者會上應詢時表示，希望印方同中方相向而行，共同落實雙方達成的共識，以實際行動維護邊境地區的和平安寧。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T13:28:24.422339+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:48:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:08:20.525822+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T13:25:25.642119+00:00","content_hash":"b9c95fee5f0d115e27242cf16215887b4ae2a097f9833875826180cfa827bc0c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}